Waze phase-two controls
-----------------------

Camera/hazard choices, speed-bump visibility, projection keep-alive, recent-list
suppression and display-mode ceiling are adapted from Forsigh/waze-patches,
commit 9cf1b4b (GPLv3), for Waze 5.26.90.901. This project adds separate native
notification/sound gates and speed-bump warning suppression, isolates projection
reconnect from phone background lifetime, preserves the stock recent fetch behind
a runtime switch, and makes the display ceiling editable and reversible.
